        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ghost Whisperer (video game), Ghost Whisperer (television series)\n- Companies: Legacy Games, CBS, Disney Channel\n- People: Jennifer Love Hewitt, Melinda Gordon\n- Platforms: Microsoft Windows, Mac OS\n- Topics: hidden-object games, mystery adventure games, acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- Jennifer Love Hewitt was born on February 21, 1979, and she is an American actress, television producer and director, singer-songwriter, and author.\n- Jennifer Love Hewitt began her acting career as a child in television commercials and in the Disney Channel series Kids Incorporated.\n- Ghost Whisperer is a casual hidden-object mystery adventure video game developed by Legacy Games for Microsoft Windows and Mac OS.\n- The Ghost Whisperer video game is based on the CBS supernatural television drama Ghost Whisperer, which stars Melinda Gordon as portrayed by Jennifer Love Hewitt.",
